        "viewport": "Original centered fmin scaling, floor origins, rounded extents and original one-percent near-equal ratio fill tolerance."
      }
    },
    "unsupported_modes": "0,1,3 and all other 32-bit values return original RES_FAIL without changing state.",
    "invalid_owner": "NULL, forged, foreign or lookalike tokens return RES_FAIL before any pointer dereference or state change.",
